{
 "duration": 24.677,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Nora's sleeping bag was rated for the cold, but at midnight her feet were freezing.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 5.232
  },
  {
   "text": "She had crawled in wearing the socks she hiked in, damp with a day of sweat.",
   "start": 5.732,
   "end": 9.652
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 10.252,
   "end": 11.179
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep one pair of dry wool socks just for sleeping, sealed in a bag.",
   "start": 11.579,
   "end": 15.399
  },
  {
   "text": "At camp, dry your feet and pull them on, loose, not tight.",
   "start": 15.849,
   "end": 19.194
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora slept warm until sunrise.",
   "start": 19.794,
   "end": 21.852
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold camp.",
   "start": 22.552,
   "end": 24.477
  }
 ],
